Label":"翻译","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:146789","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"Badriel","creatorId":"vndb:s1838","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1838","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1838","name":"Badriel","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:146791","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"Wanaca","creatorId":"vndb:s5464","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5464","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5464","name":"Wanaca","roleCode":"chardesign","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:146792","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"Exilim","creatorId":"vndb:s29888","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s29888","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s29888","name":"Exilim","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:146796","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c140267","characterName":"Gabriel","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c140267"},"originalCharacterName":"Gabriel","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An archangel of Heaven, Gabriel watches over and instructs the cupids working under her. She is supposed to serve as a shining example to her subordinates in both work ethic and personal conduct. In reality, she has a rather noticeable sadistic side towards misbehavers and is not above acting in her own self-interests. This includes hunting down the ultimate flaunter of rules, Lilim, and bringing her back to Heaven...by any means necessary."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c140267"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f0/f09b0c2b36446d7a2fd9e8840f51c06700379db8892a39e59a5b703ac614f63c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/65/6593c3404963530fed5eb95876ad90f2abbf1ba031b55f855d21b5e1bc78b4ee.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c94417","characterName":"Lilim","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c94417"},"originalCharacterName":"Lilim","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"23"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Lilim is a cupid who failed to do her duties in Heaven properly, and was banished to the human world. Lilim is incredibly lazy, and will go through to any lengths possible to avoid working. Brash and self-confident, Lilim loves flirting with cute girls – but commitment is way too much of a hassle. Will she learn to change her ways?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Steam"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c94417"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f2/f2ab4b3aacff91b975965b448d020395452771d3fa3bddd67af1908ef5aec2a3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/17/175b236edefc8731bb1fbc2001884829db825db6b7750508950646965df8515e.webp","width":205,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c94418","characterName":"Mitsuki","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c94418"},"originalCharacterName":"Mitsuki","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"20"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The human girl Lilim shoots with a 'love bullet'. While initially rude and cold towards Lilim, the moment she's hit by a 'love bullet', Mitsuki falls head over heels for her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When Mitsuki isn't reeling under the effects of a cupid's 'love bullet', she's a determined college student who’s training to be a doctor. She's also terrible at cooking."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Steam"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c94418"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/20/207cbcf7bd7056152da09fc0f8a9d37ac8234e38bec9b9dd83ca5629b7f0fa4a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c7/c7d1141c08a2a760949d2b523cd6b3430bb228419debb8a02231168a41a5303a.webp","width":205,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c94419","characterName":"Seraphim","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c94419"},"originalCharacterName":"Seraphim","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"23"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Lilim’s childhood friend. Serra is a cupid who lives in Heaven. She graduated from the Cupid Academy at the top of her class, and is incredibly gifted and able. Despite being so talented, she doesn’t have many friends, as she acts cold and aloof."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Serra is very serious, but has a secret love for cute, cuddly toys, and magical girl shows. She’ll never admit to it, though – just like she’ll never admit how much she loves Lilim."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Steam"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c94419"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9f/9fe6eaa29125f55ff95a4dcd4950067663